{
  "info": {
    "name": "Prueba tecnica - API de Clima (Laravel 13)",
    "description": "API de consulta de clima. Autenticacion por cookies de sesion con Laravel Sanctum.\n\nORDEN DE USO\n1. Ejecuta \"Obtener cookie CSRF\" una vez.\n2. Registrate o inicia sesion.\n3. El resto de las peticiones ya funcionan: Postman guarda las cookies solo.\n\nREQUISITO UNICO DE CONFIGURACION\nEl script pre-request de la coleccion lee la cookie XSRF-TOKEN y la manda como\ncabecera X-XSRF-TOKEN. Para que Postman permita leer cookies, entra a Cookies\n(bajo el boton Send) y agrega localhost a los dominios permitidos.\n\nSin esa cabecera, las peticiones POST y DELETE responden 419 (CSRF token mismatch).\n\nCODIGOS ESPERADOS\n200 lectura correcta | 201 creado | 204 eliminado | 401 sin sesion\n403 comentario ajeno | 404 ciudad no encontrada | 422 validacion | 503 OpenWeather caido",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000"
    },
    {
      "key": "frontendUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:5173"
    },
    {
      "key": "xsrf",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Lee la cookie XSRF-TOKEN y la expone como variable {{xsrf}}.",
          "// Laravel rota ese token al iniciar sesion, por eso se lee antes de cada peticion.",
          "const base = pm.collectionVariables.get('baseUrl');",
          "pm.cookies.jar().get(base, 'XSRF-TOKEN', function (err, value) {",
          "    if (!err && value) {",
          "        pm.collectionVariables.set('xsrf', decodeURIComponent(value));",
          "    }",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Autenticacion",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Obtener cookie CSRF",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Referer",
                "value": "{{frontendUrl}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/sanctum/csrf-cookie",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "sanctum",
                "csrf-cookie"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Laravel responde 204 y deja las cookies XSRF-TOKEN y de sesion. Ejecutar primero."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Registro",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Referer",
                "value": "{{frontendUrl}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-XSRF-TOKEN",
                "value": "{{xsrf}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Cayo\",\n  \"email\": \"cayo@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"password123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Crea el usuario y deja la sesion iniciada. 422 si el email ya existe."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Referer",
                "value": "{{frontendUrl}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-XSRF-TOKEN",
                "value": "{{xsrf}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"cayo@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "422 si las credenciales no coinciden."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Usuario actual",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Referer",
                "value": "{{frontendUrl}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/user",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "user"
              ]
            },
            "description": "401 si no hay sesion. Sirve para comprobar que la cookie viaja bien."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "5. Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Referer",
                "value": "{{frontendUrl}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-XSRF-TOKEN",
                "value": "{{xsrf}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "logout"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Cierra la sesion e invalida la cookie."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Climas",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Historial (publico)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Referer",
                "value": "{{frontendUrl}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/climas",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "climas"
              ]
            },
            "description": "No requiere sesion. Devuelve cada consulta con sus comentarios anidados y temp_fahrenheit."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Detalle de una consulta",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Referer",
                "value": "{{frontendUrl}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/climas/1",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "climas",
                "1"
              ]
            },
            "description": "404 si el id no existe (route model binding)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar y guardar clima",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Referer",
                "value": "{{frontendUrl}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-XSRF-TOKEN",
                "value": "{{xsrf}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/climas",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "climas"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"ciudad\": \"Quito\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "201 con el registro creado. 404 si OpenWeather no conoce la ciudad, 422 si ciudad viene vacia o con menos de 2 caracteres, 503 si OpenWeather no responde. Requiere sesion."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar consulta",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Referer",
                "value": "{{frontendUrl}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-XSRF-TOKEN",
                "value": "{{xsrf}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/climas/1",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "climas",
                "1"
              ]
            },
            "description": "204 sin cuerpo. Los comentarios se borran en cascada. Requiere sesion."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Comentarios",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Comentar una consulta",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Referer",
                "value": "{{frontendUrl}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-XSRF-TOKEN",
                "value": "{{xsrf}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/climas/1/comentarios",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "climas",
                "1",
                "comentarios"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"contenido\": \"Que fresco esta hoy\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "201. El clima sale de la URL y el autor de la sesion: el cuerpo solo lleva contenido."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar comentario",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Referer",
                "value": "{{frontendUrl}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-XSRF-TOKEN",
                "value": "{{xsrf}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/comentarios/1",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "comentarios",
                "1"
              ]
            },
            "description": "204 si eres el autor, 403 si el comentario es de otro usuario."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
